+/*
+ * The reset class of the CRG page (the vendor hi_kreset shape) is ACTIVE-LOW:
+ * the bit is SET when the line is released (deasserted) and CLEARED to drive
+ * the line into reset. This is measured, not assumed: the live census of
+ * 0x14880034 reads 0x000ff309 with both PCIe root complexes up, i.e. the four
+ * RC0 reset bits are set in the released state (UPSTREAM-PORT-PLAN arm B/C;
+ * REMAINING-DRIVERS block C). Assert must therefore clear the bit and
+ * deassert must set it.
+ */
