+  The reset lines are active-low release bits: the vendor reset class sets a
+  bit to release the line and clears it to drive the line into reset. This is
+  measured on the live part (0x14880034 reads 0x000ff309 with both PCIe root
+  complexes up, i.e. the four RC0 reset bits are set while released). Consumers
+  use the standard reset API: assert drives the line into reset, deassert
